    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030010,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふーん、そうなんですかぁ？\r\n二次審査も通ったんですねー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだか、うれしそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030020,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "さぁ、どうですかねー？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ダンスレッスンもサボらずやってきたし\r\n練習を頑張った分、やっぱり感慨もひとしおだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030030,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "別にー、ダンスは普通にできてましたしー\r\n仕事だっていつも通りにやってきましたぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030040,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まだ本気でやってるわけじゃないんでー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだってことは、いずれ本気をだしてくれるってことか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "んー、どうですかねー\r\nそういうのってー、あんまりキャラじゃないんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "レッスンも仕事も軽くやってー、サボる時はサボる\r\nそういうのが、私らしいじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、ここまでこれたんだから\r\n本気でやろうって気はあるんだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今のままで二次審査を通ったんだ\r\n本気になったら、もっとすごいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "今でもアイドルにはぜんぜん興味ないですー",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それに、アイドル活動よりー\r\n怒ってるプロデューサーを見てるほうが楽しいですしー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……てことは\r\n本当はアイドルをやりたくなかったのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今までの練習や仕事は、嫌々やってたのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そういうわけでもないですよー\r\nこれでも一応、二次審査を突破したのはうれしいですー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "次の審査も、通るといいですねー",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……このままで、いけそうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "さぁ、どうでしょうー\r\nめんどーでも、練習はちゃんと真面目にやる予定ですー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "三次審査も突破するつもりですからぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頼もしいやら、不安なのやら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7005001030130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まぁ、私はプロデューサーを不安にさせちゃう\r\n悪い子ですからぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700500103/7005001030130"
  },
